Build coherent documentation websites for polyglot software projects.

Usage: diplodocus [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build     Build a static documentation site
  check     Check documentation without writing a site
  extract   Extract a portable SQLite documentation snapshot
  generate  Generate a site using only a completed snapshot
  serve     Build and serve a site, rebuilding when declared inputs change
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <COLOR>  Control terminal colors in help, diagnostics, and status output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --no-progress    Print stage summaries instead of animated progress bars
  -q, --quiet          Suppress routine status output while retaining warnings and errors
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
